[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b003:l033","ordinal":182273,"en":"Resourceful uncle"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b003:l034","ordinal":182274,"en":"Has the majesty of a countless host."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b003:l035","ordinal":182275,"en":"You found words in sudden danger;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b003:l036","ordinal":182276,"en":"If you are truly a khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b003:l037","ordinal":182277,"en":"My dear uncle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b003:l038","ordinal":182278,"en":"Find sight in the darkness."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b003:l039","ordinal":182279,"en":"Join together what is broken;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b003:l040","ordinal":182280,"en":"Gather together what is scattered!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l001","ordinal":182281,"en":"Find a road where there is none;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l002","ordinal":182282,"en":"If you are truly a lion—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l003","ordinal":182283,"en":"Lion uncle Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l004","ordinal":182284,"en":"Find a place where the horseless boys"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l005","ordinal":182285,"en":"Can be left in safekeeping!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l006","ordinal":182286,"en":"If the horse dies from carrying two,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l007","ordinal":182287,"en":"And we die from hardship,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l008","ordinal":182288,"en":"What desire shall we attain?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l009","ordinal":182289,"en":"Better that we leave the boys"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l010","ordinal":182290,"en":"With the baggage train!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l011","ordinal":182291,"en":"After Semetey said this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l012","ordinal":182292,"en":"His uncle, old Bakai—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l013","ordinal":182293,"en":"The holy clairvoyant,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l014","ordinal":182294,"en":"The revered kinsman and saint—said:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l015","ordinal":182295,"en":"“Very well, my son, very well;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l016","ordinal":182296,"en":"What you say is wise."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l017","ordinal":182297,"en":"If we take the boys double,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l018","ordinal":182298,"en":"Toward what goal can we proceed?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l019","ordinal":182299,"en":"Better that we entrust them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l020","ordinal":182300,"en":"To God in some place"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l021","ordinal":182301,"en":"And leave them with the baggage train!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l022","ordinal":182302,"en":"Kakanchin's Beijing is a formidable city;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l023","ordinal":182303,"en":"May gracious Allah grant a road—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l024","ordinal":182304,"en":"How many places hold peril!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l025","ordinal":182305,"en":"The Chinese are no feeble people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l026","ordinal":182306,"en":"When their jang-jun issues a decree,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l027","ordinal":182307,"en":"They are not a people who spare their lives."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l028","ordinal":182308,"en":"Beijing is no feeble land;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l029","ordinal":182309,"en":"You will fight the Kakanchin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l030","ordinal":182310,"en":"No people for mortals to assail!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l031","ordinal":182311,"en":"An earthen rampart encircles it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l032","ordinal":182312,"en":"Within that rampart"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l033","ordinal":182313,"en":"Dwell the unruly Chinese people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l034","ordinal":182314,"en":"God knows whether we shall reach it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l035","ordinal":182315,"en":"God knows whether we shall remain alive"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l036","ordinal":182316,"en":"And not die in Beijing!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l037","ordinal":182317,"en":"That is a people of painful calamity;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l038","ordinal":182318,"en":"That is the pass of Beijing we must fight!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l039","ordinal":182319,"en":"It has guards and a khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1389:b004:l040","ordinal":182320,"en":"Dear Beijing of Zuntung"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l001","ordinal":182321,"en":"Holds perils in many places."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l002","ordinal":182322,"en":"When your uncle Bakai speaks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l003","ordinal":182323,"en":"He has words of countless kinds."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l004","ordinal":182324,"en":"If we journey farther,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l005","ordinal":182325,"en":"I have a place where I can leave"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l006","ordinal":182326,"en":"My dear boys with the baggage train!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l007","ordinal":182327,"en":"When I count the days of old,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l008","ordinal":182328,"en":"My insides burn and my liver is aflame;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l009","ordinal":182329,"en":"What does this Bakai hold within him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l010","ordinal":182330,"en":"And what does he not!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l011","ordinal":182331,"en":"When I tell the tale of my earlier days,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l012","ordinal":182332,"en":"I seem to remember them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l013","ordinal":182333,"en":"When this wretched soul counts his companion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l014","ordinal":182334,"en":"I wither and wither away!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l015","ordinal":182335,"en":"When I speak of my former days,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l016","ordinal":182336,"en":"With my beard white as a swan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l017","ordinal":182337,"en":"At the time I leave on a journey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l018","ordinal":182338,"en":"I seem to boast!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l019","ordinal":182339,"en":"There is the land of Beijing to strike,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l020","ordinal":182340,"en":"And a marvelous people for us to fight!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l021","ordinal":182341,"en":"If we leave the baggage train for six months,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l022","ordinal":182342,"en":"There is a place mortals long to see!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l023","ordinal":182343,"en":"There is a pass made secure,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l024","ordinal":182344,"en":"There is a place mortals do not see;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l025","ordinal":182345,"en":"It is the pass on which I have set my resolve."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l026","ordinal":182346,"en":"If we travel onward from here,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l027","ordinal":182347,"en":"Let me tell you the nature of the land:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l028","ordinal":182348,"en":"Pass follows pass,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l029","ordinal":182349,"en":"And low, rolling hills appear!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l030","ordinal":182350,"en":"Many a rounded mountain appears;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l031","ordinal":182351,"en":"If we travel along the mountain foot,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l032","ordinal":182352,"en":"We come to the lands of Kök-Suu and Kushtai."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l033","ordinal":182353,"en":"We shall pass beyond those two;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l034","ordinal":182354,"en":"The twin ravines of Echki-Ölbös"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l035","ordinal":182355,"en":"Rise with their ridges in view,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l036","ordinal":182356,"en":"And your mighty uncle Bakai's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l037","ordinal":182357,"en":"Heart will then be torn!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l038","ordinal":182358,"en":"When we climb that ridge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l039","ordinal":182359,"en":"Its corners appear dim,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b003:l040","ordinal":182360,"en":"And its peaks rise hazy!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l001","ordinal":182361,"en":"Bulging beyond the reach of sight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l002","ordinal":182362,"en":"The mountain summit appears."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l003","ordinal":182363,"en":"My dear foals,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l004","ordinal":182364,"en":"My heart is torn here!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l005","ordinal":182365,"en":"On a jutting mountain spur,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l006","ordinal":182366,"en":"Upon a hanging promontory,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l007","ordinal":182367,"en":"Are rugged black ridges—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l008","ordinal":182368,"en":"Here is a wondrous tale!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l009","ordinal":182369,"en":"There are Üch-Jyrgalang and Köngüz;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l010","ordinal":182370,"en":"If you see this place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l011","ordinal":182371,"en":"It holds a whole, level world!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l012","ordinal":182372,"en":"There are wild boars in its forest,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l013","ordinal":182373,"en":"Red deer at its bends,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l014","ordinal":182374,"en":"Argali upon its hills,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l015","ordinal":182375,"en":"Foxes upon its plains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l016","ordinal":182376,"en":"Tigers upon its ridges."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l017","ordinal":182377,"en":"Lofty mountains rise jagged;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l018","ordinal":182378,"en":"Upon those heights dwell"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l019","ordinal":182379,"en":"Wild goats and ibex!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l020","ordinal":182380,"en":"There are bears upon its slopes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l021","ordinal":182381,"en":"And how many wondrous creatures."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l022","ordinal":182382,"en":"There is snow upon its mountains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l023","ordinal":182383,"en":"And rooks within its forests;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l024","ordinal":182384,"en":"Every living creature is there!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l025","ordinal":182385,"en":"What a wonder it is to behold:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l026","ordinal":182386,"en":"Its birds hatch in the birches;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l027","ordinal":182387,"en":"If you do not die, boys, you will see"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l028","ordinal":182388,"en":"How they lash the air in flight."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l029","ordinal":182389,"en":"Its birds hatch in the poplars,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l030","ordinal":182390,"en":"Driving the air with their wings!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l031","ordinal":182391,"en":"The breeds of game are scattered there;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l032","ordinal":182392,"en":"A brave man's heart opens,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l033","ordinal":182393,"en":"And an eager youth rejoices."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l034","ordinal":182394,"en":"When bright dawn breaks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l035","ordinal":182395,"en":"When light falls upon the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l036","ordinal":182396,"en":"Geese, cranes, and demoiselle cranes"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l037","ordinal":182397,"en":"Cry out loudly enough to split the ears!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l038","ordinal":182398,"en":"There are swans among its reeds;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l039","ordinal":182399,"en":"Ripe walnuts fill the ravines,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1390:b004:l040","ordinal":182400,"en":"And its apples lie in dark heaps;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l001","ordinal":182401,"en":"It was a place where people lived."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l002","ordinal":182402,"en":"The head of the willow is bent,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l003","ordinal":182403,"en":"The surface of the sand is scratched,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l004","ordinal":182404,"en":"I was surprised to see"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l005","ordinal":182405,"en":"He was happy to see Azamat!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l006","ordinal":182406,"en":"When you bend down, oh boys,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l007","ordinal":182407,"en":"If you are drunk, lust will be written."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l008","ordinal":182408,"en":"A lot of different people!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l009","ordinal":182409,"en":"When the man leans in,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l010","ordinal":182410,"en":"There are Mangkan and Kordoi,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l011","ordinal":182411,"en":"There is a lot of land."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l012","ordinal":182412,"en":"Enough Bakay air"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l013","ordinal":182413,"en":"Respect what he said!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l014","ordinal":182414,"en":"As long as I remember"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l015","ordinal":182415,"en":"I didn't see Eminem."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l016","ordinal":182416,"en":"I did not know what!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l017","ordinal":182417,"en":"Fun, lots of games,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l018","ordinal":182418,"en":"I have lost my mind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l019","ordinal":182419,"en":"My beloved Manas is there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l020","ordinal":182420,"en":"Sunrise and sunset"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l021","ordinal":182421,"en":"I was calling everyone!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l022","ordinal":182422,"en":"My statue is Manas Bar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l023","ordinal":182423,"en":"I scrolled the hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l024","ordinal":182424,"en":"Four corners of a circle"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l025","ordinal":182425,"en":"I wandered around!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l026","ordinal":182426,"en":"I have seven Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l027","ordinal":182427,"en":"Mountains and rocks, waters"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l028","ordinal":182428,"en":"Here I am, Bakai!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l029","ordinal":182429,"en":"The bottom of the earth is Jelpinish,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l030","ordinal":182430,"en":"Beijing at sunrise"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l031","ordinal":182431,"en":"I see Bakai!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l032","ordinal":182432,"en":"Your uncle who saw you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l033","ordinal":182433,"en":"Your grandfather who has seen a lot"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l034","ordinal":182434,"en":"The blue horse does not walk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l035","ordinal":182435,"en":"As long as I can"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l036","ordinal":182436,"en":"Is there anything on earth?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l037","ordinal":182437,"en":"The blue spearhead was untouched"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l038","ordinal":182438,"en":"Do people have everything!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l039","ordinal":182439,"en":"Kuu did not kick the devil"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b003:l040","ordinal":182440,"en":"Is there anything in the chase?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l001","ordinal":182441,"en":"My friend Manas is at the bar"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l002","ordinal":182442,"en":"Bakay's hand was untouched"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l003","ordinal":182443,"en":"Do people have everything!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l004","ordinal":182444,"en":"Four corners of a circle"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l005","ordinal":182445,"en":"Isn't it Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l006","ordinal":182446,"en":"All of the universe"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l007","ordinal":182447,"en":"While walking"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l008","ordinal":182448,"en":"Isn't it a wandering Bakai?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l009","ordinal":182449,"en":"Don't put up half a mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l010","ordinal":182450,"en":"Half a spring does not put water,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l011","ordinal":182451,"en":"Light is in Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l012","ordinal":182452,"en":"Isn't it a wandering Bakai?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l013","ordinal":182453,"en":"People have seen it everywhere."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l014","ordinal":182454,"en":"He saw land from a dark place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l015","ordinal":182455,"en":"The number started the number of hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l016","ordinal":182456,"en":"This world is ugly"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l017","ordinal":182457,"en":"Aban Bakay is like a white road"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l018","ordinal":182458,"en":"Looked and left!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l019","ordinal":182459,"en":"The number that comes out of his mouth is golden"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l020","ordinal":182460,"en":"Chachyp Bakai is going,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l021","ordinal":182461,"en":"The road he saw"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l022","ordinal":182462,"en":"Basip Bakay is walking."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l023","ordinal":182463,"en":"A big river that no one can see"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l024","ordinal":182464,"en":"Leaving Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l025","ordinal":182465,"en":"The neck is rough"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1391:b004:l